      "description": "Introducing our \"Realistic Lemon Juicer\" 3D model, a true-to-life digital replica perfect for kitchenware enthusiasts and culinary artists. Created with Blender, this model offers exceptional detail that simulates the actual mechanics and aesthetics of a manual juicer. Its ergonomic design and functional elements make it a valuable resource for product designers, animators, and advertisers seeking to showcase kitchen gadgets. The model is equipped with features like a textured handle for a realistic grip and a ridged juicing cone for effective citrus extraction—ideal for visualizing in action or as part of a more extensive kitchen setup. Enhance your culinary-themed projects with this versatile and beautifully crafted digital asset.",
